  "name": "FAB Menu",
  "category": "Actions",
  "parent": null,
  "description": "A FAB that fans out into 2–6 related actions. Anchors to an existing md-fab by id, morphs that FAB's icon to close while open, and manages the popup's ARIA wiring, roving focus, and dismissal.",
